            bindings = <
&none  &none  &none  &none  &none                                          &none       &none   ASSYM(S_EQL, JP_MINS)    ASSYM(S_TILDE, JP_CIRC)   ASSYM(S_PIPE, JP_YEN_MAC)
&none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none                        &none      &none       &none   &none                    ASSYM(S_BQ, JP_AT)        ASSYM(S_LCBR, JP_LBKT)
&kp LEFT_SHIFT  &none  &none  &none  &none  &kp LANG2           &kp LANG1      &none       &none   ASSYM(S_PLUS, JP_SEMI)   ASSYM(S_ASTR, JP_COLN)    ASSYM(S_RCBR, JP_RBKT)
